#: ../../tools/migrations/migrations.rst:2
msgid "Migrations"
msgstr "Migrações"

#: ../../tools/migrations/migrations.rst:4
msgid ""
"The bulk migration tool enables VMware vCenter workloads to be migrated "
"to HVM (HPE Morpheus Virtual Machine) Clusters. Migration Plans "
"orchestrate the end-to-end process: preparing source VMs, streaming disk "
"data, converting storage formats, and bringing workloads online on the "
"target HVM infrastructure. Both Linux and Windows workloads are "
"supported, with automated VirtIO driver injection for Windows guests."
msgstr "A ferramenta de migração em massa permite migrar workloads do VMware vCenter para Clusters HVM (HPE Morpheus Virtual Machine). Migration Plans orquestram o processo de ponta a ponta: preparação das VMs de origem, streaming dos dados de disco, conversão de formatos de armazenamento e colocação dos workloads online na infraestrutura HVM de destino. Workloads Linux e Windows são suportados, com injeção automatizada de drivers VirtIO para guests Windows."

